          "message": "polish Finance Short 02 into V3: retimed builds, original ducked soundtrack\n\nTargeted V3 pass on the existing animation (artwork, layouts and narration unchanged; V2 files kept):\n- retime confirmed fast builds found on the V2 encoded file (S02 policy, S03 calculation,\n  S04/S05 recap, S06 cover/before, S04 opening), one lettering morph (0.25% -> 0.25% = 0.0025)\n- three registered FACE_* expression overlays (107/114 assets) and a 1.3 s end hold for the payoff\n- original procedural music bed + 10 original effects (tools/sound.py), ducked under the\n  untouched narration; -1.5 dBTP, narration 23.1 dB above the rest\n- V3 final, preview from the final, narration-only safety copy, QA, edit register and licences\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
